/* Issue #67: with 800+ distinct tokens, the C++ skeleton's YY_ASSERT line in
   symbol_type constructors became a single line over 21,740 characters,
   hitting MSVC's C2026 "string too big" limit (fixed upstream in bison
   3.7.4). This fixture is committed directly with ~900 tokens; compiling
   clean is the whole assertion. Uses the "complete symbols" API
   (api.token.constructor + variant) since that's what generates the
   symbol_type constructors the bug was in. */
